    "cls": "",
    "html": "<p class=\"kicker\">A locked door</p>\n    <div class=\"fill\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A heavy planked door banded in iron, its keyhole scratched about by somebody who has already tried\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M256 524 V218 A194 194 0 0 1 644 218 V524\"/><path d=\"M236 524 H664\"/></g><path d=\"M306 177 L264 165\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M350 107 L320 74\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M424 70 L416 27\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M506 79 L523 38\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M571 130 L607 104\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M594 177 L636 165\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M256 300 H300 M600 300 H644\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M256 382 H300 M600 382 H644\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M256 464 H300 M600 464 H644\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\"/><g fill=\"#f7f4ec\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M300 524 V218 A150 150 0 0 1 600 218 V524 Z\"/></g><clipPath id=\"dr\"><path d=\"M300 524 V218 A150 150 0 0 1 600 218 V524 Z\"/></clipPath><g clip-path=\"url(#dr)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M348 50 V524\"/><path d=\"M396 50 V524\"/><path d=\"M450 50 V524\"/><path d=\"M504 50 V524\"/><path d=\"M552 50 V524\"/></g><g fill=\"#f7f4ec\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"300\" y=\"282\" width=\"300\" height=\"28\" rx=\"2\"/></g><g fill=\"#f7f4ec\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"300\" y=\"428\" width=\"300\" height=\"28\" rx=\"2\"/></g><g fill=\"#16140f\" stroke=\"none\"><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"296\" r=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"366\" cy=\"296\" r=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"412\" cy=\"296\" r=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"458\" cy=\"296\" r=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"504\" cy=\"296\" r=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"296\" r=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"596\" cy=\"296\" r=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"442\" r=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"366\" cy=\"442\" r=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"412\" cy=\"442\" r=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"458\" cy=\"442\" r=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"504\" cy=\"442\" r=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"442\" r=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"596\" cy=\"442\" r=\"4.5\"/></g><g fill=\"#f7f4ec\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"352\" y=\"334\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\"/></g><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"366\" cy=\"380\" r=\"28\"/></g><g fill=\"#f7f4ec\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"494\" y=\"322\" width=\"80\" height=\"102\" rx=\"6\"/></g><g fill=\"#16140f\" stroke=\"none\"><circle cx=\"534\" cy=\"358\" r=\"11\"/><path d=\"M528 364 L540 364 L537 398 L531 398 Z\"/></g><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4a453a\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M510 360 L482 348\"/><path d=\"M518 351 L504 333\"/><path d=\"M510 380 L488 389\"/><path d=\"M552 354 L567 341\"/><path d=\"M531 394 L530 411\"/></g></svg></div>\n    <p class=\"body\" style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>The door is locked and the key is somewhere else. What do you do?</strong></p>"
