    "html": "<p class=\"kicker\">Kinspire &middot; Player 101 &middot; A4</p><h1>Table Etiquette and Good Player Behavior</h1><p class=\"body\" style=\"max-width:74%\">An hour on being somebody the rest of the table is glad showed up.</p><div class=\"rule\" style=\"margin-top:1.4em\"></div>"
