    "cls": "center",
    "html": "<p class=\"kicker\">The whole class, in one line</p><p class=\"big\" style=\"max-width:92%;text-align:center\">A good player is not a good roleplayer. A good player is somebody the rest of the table is glad showed up.</p><p class=\"body\" style=\"margin-top:1.1em;max-width:80%\">Everything in this hour is available to somebody on their first evening, which is not true of any other skill in the player track.</p>"
