    "label": "Ask the room",
    "note": "Subject 1, 6 min. Three answers, then name the pattern.",
    "cls": "center",
    "html": "<p class=\"kicker\">Name a player you liked sitting with</p><h2 style=\"max-width:84%\">Almost nobody says they were good at the rules, and almost nobody says they did voices.</h2><p class=\"body\" style=\"margin-top:1.2em;max-width:80%\">The answers come back as: they listened, they were pleased when my thing worked, they turned up.</p>"
