" text-anchor=\"start\">same width</text><path d=\"M140 452 V474 H627.2 V452\" stroke=\"#4a453a\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"383.6\" y=\"514\" font-size=\"25\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#16140f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">taken from the other five</text><path d=\"M140 566 H1300\" stroke=\"#4a453a\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"720\" y=\"614\" font-size=\"30\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#16140f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Taking more is not a crime. It is arithmetic.</text></svg></div>"
