    "html": "<p class=\"kicker\">The whole class, in one line</p><p class=\"big\" style=\"max-width:90%;text-align:center\">The gap between an easy player and a tiring one is about five minutes a week.</p><p class=\"body\" style=\"margin-top:1.1em;max-width:80%\">Most people were never told there was anything to do between sessions. Nothing is a reasonable answer, and this hour is not a telling-off.</p>"
