    "cls": "center",
    "html": "<p class=\"kicker\">Kinspire &middot; Player 101 &middot; A13</p><h1>Surviving Traps and Solving Puzzles</h1><p class=\"body\" style=\"max-width:74%\">Two obstacles that behave oppositely, and the small repair each one needs.</p><div class=\"rule\" style=\"margin-top:1.4em\"></div>"
